<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Regnis interim net up seven pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Regnis interim net up seven pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  H1 1996	    H2 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		   125.05   vs	127.45</p>
<p>    Net profit		   5.47   vs	  5.12</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.00   vs	  0.80</p>
<p>NOTE - Regnis (Lanka) Ltd, a subsidiary of multinational Singer Co, makes refrigerators, freezers, fans and washing machines for the local market.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
